#   attractor_source(+Name, -Surface): a closed surface term whose beta eta
#   normal form is the attractor's Function. A prelude function that does
#   not recur is the prelude's term; a `fixpoint` one is the body the
#   prelude hands its fixpoint, with its dependencies as leading
#   parameters.
#
# Each text is from_cbor of a string literal, a Scott list of bytes,
# imported from corpora/library/text/cbor. FIXME: the import projects "corpora" https://github.com/Atry/private-overlay/issues/1923
# off the variable gezi, the name of the project root's own
# directory; it breaks if that directory is renamed.
#
# Every source is a term of this file: the prelude's pieces are imported from
# problems/prelude_clauses, the sources other sources use are let-bound first,
# and the table lists each by name. A source is spelled as written here, the
# names it uses substituted and nothing evaluated, so `not b` stays an
# application of the source of not.
